/-!
# Stage-zero balanced Sonine energy compression

The common parameter-independent balanced energy face is compressed after
the actual stage-zero half-density translation.  Contractivity and the
Fourier/J--adjoint sibling law are generated by the existing conservative
compression kernel.  The two zero-owned energy coordinates are actual
elements of this one face; no nonzero-coordinate or full eigenlaw premise is
introduced.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ResponsibilityLifecycle
namespace LivingLawEvolution
namespace ConstructiveRoot
